          "• Each UDF can be tested separately and more thoroughly with different inputs compared to a single large program with no UDFs. (See Chapter 6.) DID YOU KKNNOOWW??",
          "I I n f y t o h u is a t c e c x i t d b e o n o t k a , l ly w e tr y w i t l o l l r i e m a i s t s i o g u n r s a e l g v l e o s b a to l v r a e r a i d a b a le cc , e y s o s u f o m r a g y l o f b in a d l v th a a ri t a b yo le u s r .",
          "existing code no longer works. For example, let us consider a simple function example() that prints the value of a global variable number:",
