          "Software engineering is the process of designing, KEY TERMS creating, and maintaining software applications. In general, there are five stages in developing a program. Software Engineering The process of designing, creating, and This is a version of the traditional “waterfall model” maintaining software applications of software development where progress flows through multiple stages in a sequential manner and each stage is completed before moving on to the next stage, just like how a waterfall flows downward in a single direction.",
