          "FIND() =FIND(find_text, Returns the location of find_text in within_text, start_num) within_text using a case-sensitive • start_num is an optional search starting from start_num.",
          "argument Example 1: If start_num is left out, the search starts =FIND(\"na\", \"banana\") from the first character of within_text.",
          "This would return 3.",
