          "r ia n l h c o u w s t t o w m o s o . r P m ro o t r o e c d o e ls v ic a e re s D K I K D N N YO OO U WW??",
          "For the protocols used to communicate over the Internet, data is not sent as a single continuous stream but is broken up into smaller packets before being sent independently over the network through hardware such as switches and Devices communicate over the routers (see section 10.4.2). Besides containing a piece of Internet using two related protocols:",
