          "2. A user discovers malware running on a computer even though there is an anti-malware program that is also running on the same computer. Suggest some reasons to explain how this is possible.",
          "3. A website asks for the user’s consent to share their email address, with a notice that the purpose for collecting the user’s email address will be provided afterwards. Explain whether the website complies with the PDPA.",
