          "14.1.2 Common Applications In recent years, developments in computing power, advanced algorithms and the availability of large data sets have enabled significant and ongoing advancements in AI. As of 2024, AI can excel in a multitude of tasks. Some common personal and business tasks that can be performed well by AI are summarised in Table 14.1.",
